      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "王明，你能帮我看一下这条消息吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "可以。你哪里不明白？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "他说“下午再说”，我不知道是不是不同意。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "不一定。这里更像是现在没有时间。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "所以不是直接拒绝，对吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对。要看前后说了什么。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "前面我问他能不能今天确认。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "那就很可能是下午有时间再确认。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "明白了。我刚才有点儿担心。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "工作消息有时候很短，所以容易想多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我需要现在回复吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "可以简单回复“好的，下午再联系”。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样不会太正式吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "不会，很自然，也很清楚。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，我就这么回。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "以后不确定的时候，也可以先问一句。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样比自己猜好得多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc008_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对，沟通清楚最重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
